        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Each employee on payroll on November 2, 1981 and covered by this Agreement shall receive an increase in his/her base rate of ten (10%) percent of his/her August 21, 1981 rate, retroactive to August 31, 1981. Employees on layoff status shall receive this increase for the period of time they worked from August 31, 1981 until their date of layoff, and the increase shall be included in their base rate in the event of recall. Minimum and maximum rates for all groups are raised ten (10%) percent effective August 31, 1981 and adjusted to a round dollar figure. A list of the adjusted group minimums and maximums is set forth below:",
